        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "01e6da8f",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "**Metric definitions** (full text: docs/KPI\\_DEFINITIONS.md in the project repository)\n",
                "\n",
                "- Total return (K2) = last adjclose / adjclose on the base date (2019-01-02) - 1.\n",
                "- Volatility (K4/K5) = sample standard deviation of daily returns on normal (traded) sessions × √252; K4 uses the last 60 sessions.\n",
                "- Drawdown (K6) = adjclose / running peak - 1; max drawdown (K7) is its minimum; peak date = the day the peak was set.\n",
                "- Monthly / yearly return (K8/K9) = period-end adjclose / previous period-end adjclose - 1; the first period starts at the base date.\n",
                "- Partial = first period, or the period still running at the snapshot's last trade date."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 40,
            "width": 12,
